      "toNode": "a101000000000005",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "At step n ≥ 1, use information from n − 1 · 第 n 步使用上一期信息"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae00000000000005",
      "fromNode": "a102000000000001",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a102000000000009",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Add an integrable initial value known at time 0 · 累积增量并保留初始可积已知量"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae00000000000006",
      "fromNode": "a101000000000003",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a102000000000002",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Add per-time integrability and conditional equality · 再加逐时可积与条件均值等式"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae00000000000007",
      "fromNode": "a102000000000002",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a102000000000003",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Equality implies future conditional mean ≥ current value · 等式蕴含次鞅不等式"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae00000000000008",
      "fromNode": "a102000000000002",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "a102000000000004",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Equality implies future conditional mean ≤ current value · 等式蕴含超鞅不等式"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae00000000000009",
      "fromNode": "a102000000000002",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a102000000000006",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Constant means are necessary, not sufficient · 恒定均值必要但不充分"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae00000000000010",
      "fromNode": "a102000000000002",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a102000000000007",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Convex transformation plus per-time integrability · 凸变换并逐时点检查可积性"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae00000000000011",
      "fromNode": "a102000000000007",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "a102000000000003",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "得到次鞅"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae00000000000012",
      "fromNode": "a102000000000003",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a102000000000008",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Constant means force each nonnegative conditional gain to vanish · 恒均值使非负条件增益消失"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae00000000000014",
      "fromNode": "a102000000000003",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a102000000000005",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "In discrete time, accumulate predicted gains starting at zero · 离散时间从零累积条件预期增益"
